;
; The 12 names the title imports from xmem.dll (artifacts/docs/master-exe-surface.md),
; the one the shim spec documents beyond them (XMemVirtualQuery), and the seven the
; reference export enumeration shows in a real xmem.dll (Set/GetAllocationHysteresis,
; GetAllocationStatistics, SetAllocationHooks, MakeTag, PreallocateFreeSpace,
; GetWin32HeapStatistics). There is no genuine xmem.dll in this tree to compare
; against, so this list IS the contract: every name is derived from an artifact or a
; reference enumeration, none is invented. The seven not imported by this title are
; refusals in src/xmem.cpp -- they return 0 and touch nothing.
EXPORTS
    XMemAlloc
    XMemAllocDefault
    XMemFree
    XMemFreeDefault
    XMemVirtualQuery
    XMemGetWorkingSetStatistics
    XMemVirtualAlloc
    XMemAllocatePhysicalPages
    XMemFreePhysicalPages
    XMemMapPhysicalPages
    XMemMapPhysicalPagesScatter
    XMemTransferMemory
    XMemIsToolsMemAvailable
    XMemSetAllocationHooks
    XMemGetAllocationStatistics
    XMemGetAllocationHysteresis
    XMemSetAllocationHysteresis
    XMemMakeTag
    XMemPreallocateFreeSpace
    XMemGetWin32HeapStatistics
